What is a decision tree and why is it appropriate for your problem?
 A decision tree is a supervised learning model that splits up data into multiple branches of yes/no questions, and branches out into different leaf nodes depending on the answer. It’s a good fit for this because determining whether or not someone will golf is naturally a series of yes/no conditions, like is it a holiday? Is it too windy? Is it raining? Etc. 
